    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14289" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dis-părĭlis</span></b> ,
		e, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj., dissimilar, different</i> (very rare): 
